  fhir:ActivityDefinition.description [ fhir:value "One sig from HemOnc Regimen 2554 ('Carboplatin and Paclitaxel (CP)') Variant #83 (cui 144842). Carboplatin as primary systemic component, target AUC 5 IV over 30–60 minutes, day 1 of a 21-day cycle, for 3–6 cycles. The declared dose is a target AUC; the dynamicValue invokes the Calvert helper to compute the mg at $apply time using the patient's GFR."] ;
